"ASIO, CoreAudio) only."
msgstr ""
"启用时，每个会话的硬件到硬件连接会在载入会话时恢复。此设置仅适用于内部后端（ALSA、Portaudio/ASIO、CoreAudio）。"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4884
msgid "Allow non quarter-note pulse"
msgstr "允许非四分音符脉冲"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4889
