msgstr "波形图像缓存尺寸（兆字节）"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5278
msgid ""
"Increasing the cache size uses more memory to store waveform images, which "
"can improve graphical performance."
msgstr ""
"增加缓存大小会使用更多的内存来存储波形图像，可以提高图形性能。"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5286
msgid "Thinning factor (larger value => less data)"
msgstr "稀释参数（较大的数值 => 较少的数据）"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5295
msgid "Automation sampling interval (milliseconds)"
msgstr "自动化采样间隔（毫秒）"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5301
msgid "Automatables"
msgstr "可自动化参数"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5305
msgid "Limit automatable parameters per plugin"
msgstr "限制每个插件的可自动化参数"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5312
msgid "256 parameters"
msgstr "256 个参数"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5313
msgid "512 parameters"
msgstr "512 个参数"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5314
msgid "999 parameters"
msgstr "999 个参数"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:5317
msgid ""
"Some Plugins expose an unreasonable amount of control-inputs. This option "
"limits the number of parameters that are listed as automatable without "
"restricting the number of total controls.\n"
"\n"
"This reduces lag in the GUI and shortens excessively long drop-down lists "
"for plugins with a large number of control ports.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This only affects newly added plugins and is applied to plugin on "
"session-reload. Already automated parameters are retained."
msgstr ""
"某些插件提供数量不合理的控制输入。此选项限制列为可自动化参数的数量，但不限制控制项总数。\n"
"\n"
"这会减少图形界面延迟，并缩短控制端口较多的插件所产生的过长下拉列表。\n"
"\n"
"注意：此选项只影响新添加的插件，并在重新载入会话时应用于插件。已有的自动化参数会保留。"

